# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Defensive ignore list for a CLOSED-SOURCE showcase repo.
# The point of this repo is to publish writeups WITHOUT publishing source,
# secrets, or data. This list makes it hard to leak any of that by accident.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Secrets & environment — NEVER commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets*
credentials*
*token*
*apikey*
*api_key*

# Proprietary source (do not vendor the real implementations into this repo)
/hieuluat-src/
/gen-system-src/
*.go            # gen-system is Go; keep its source out of the showcase
# (Python snippets in /snippets are intentional and small; the real HieuLuat
#  source should never be placed in this repo — keep it in its private repo.)

# Data — legal corpus, embeddings, eval inputs, dumps
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.dump
*.bak
/data/
/bk_data/
/bk_data_2/
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
embeddings/
corpus/

# Build / deps / caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
